e\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9151e3862b504f18a0ea8c55\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0250\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"指出需要更多临床试验来确定最佳供体、给药频率、长期安全性以及益生菌的具体菌株选择。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1bd8d8dfe3db59cf0389c7a5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0250\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文主要聚焦于黑色素瘤，其结论在其他实体瘤中的适用性需结合其他研究进行验证，不能直接外推。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::df6fca6ebe442dac256760bf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0250\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的机制（如特定菌种与T细胞活化的关系）多基于已发表的研究汇总，部分可能源自动物模型，临床因果关系尚未完全确立。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9bcca453aa0ce0902a917b68\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0250\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"FMT的证据主要来自小规模研究（如Davari et al.），其长期安全性和最佳实践方案仍在探索中，不应视为成熟的标准治疗方案。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d5e3281f6e7fa4156b3d92ae\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0250\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"益生菌的使用存在安全争议，文中明确提到需谨慎，避免将其简单推荐为通用辅助疗法。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c9d047023382a3f265959f89\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0250\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"综述未提供具体的文献检索策略和质量评估细节，因此其结论的代表性取决于其所引用的原始研究的质量。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8db1e4accbd95f8d3a89e34d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0250\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e6c26d84a16f2a929d0235ad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::681007cc53abdcfcc8cd089d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3ee898ac21789411a52117b5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用PRISMA指南指导的系统综述方法。检索策略覆盖PubMed、ClinicalTrials.gov及主要肿瘤学会议摘要。纳入标准限定为接受ICI联合FMT治疗的实体瘤患者，排除仅关注免疫微环境变化或无具体数据的回顾性研究。使用Cochrane ROB 2.0和ROBINS-I工具评估偏倚风险。统计分析使用Stata 18和R语言，以ORR为主要终点，CR、PR、PFS、OS及不良事件为次要终点。对于生存数据，因多数研究未报告风险比（HR），采用加权平均中位数进行初步评估。亚组分析基于ICI策略、供体来源、给药途径和肿瘤类型进行。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::119ebc43a2985e2a4447adb7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了FMT联合ICI治疗实体瘤的汇总疗效数据（ORR 43%），并量化了不同ICI策略（特别是双药联合）对疗效的显著影响。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给材料未交代具体的微生物组测序深度、特定菌株定植率的长期追踪数据，以及FMT对ICI耐药性的逆转机制的直接实验证据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fe78db4b46d3dbef7d9279bd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"明确了FMT联合治疗的安全性特征，指出其不显著增加严重不良事件风险，甚至可能在某些情况下降低irAEs。\",\n          \"limits\": \"安全性数据主要来自短期随访，缺乏长期安全性监测，无法评估迟发性不良反应或微生物组改变的持久性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ef62572c2550368d6d7be5ad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"识别了关键的方法学异质性来源，如供体选择（ICI反应者vs健康人）和给药途径对结果的潜在影响。\",\n          \"limits\": \"纳入研究多为单臂或小样本RCT，缺乏大规模多中心对照，导致效应估计可能存在选择偏倚，且无法确立因果关系。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8c63451a85ee66b9f1eb5f8b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"所有纳入的10项研究（n=164），混合ICI方案\",\n          \"finding\": \"总体客观缓解率（ORR）为43% (95% CI: 0.35–0.51)，存在中度异质性 (I² = 59%)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::df7528cb4eaf951099448813\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"亚组：抗PD-1联合抗CTLA-4双药治疗 vs 抗PD-1单药\",\n          \"finding\": \"双药治疗ORR显著更高（60% vs 37%, P=0.01），且双药组内异质性低 (I² = 0)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7484febb7596aa2dc9f5d798\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"亚组：供体来源为ICI反应者 vs 健康人或商业制剂\",\n          \"finding\": \"ICI反应者供体的ORR较高（46%），但组间差异无统计学意义；该亚组内存在显著异质性 (I² = 66%)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::30fe18ce8132f66ab3ac68b5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"亚组：口服粪菌胶囊 vs 内镜移植\",\n          \"finding\": \"口服胶囊ORR较高（49% vs 34%），但组间差异无统计学意义；该亚组内存在显著异质性 (I² = 68%)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a37818ba99c42a167452781b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"安全性评估：所有研究\",\n          \"finding\": \"1-2级不良事件发生率42% (95% CI: 0.32–0.52)，3-4级为37% (95% CI: 0.28–0.46)。双药治疗组的3-4级AE发生率高于单药组。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f70ea71f79c1728e17d292d8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"生存分析：部分研究提供的中位数据\",\n          \"finding\": \"加权平均中位无进展生存期（mPFS）为8.32个月，中位总生存期（mOS）为12.67个月。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e6bef402b84076e2fc312e73\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bb50d6fc7d72546d3b0b14c5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"解决FMT在增强ICI疗效方面的临床证据碎片化问题，明确其有效性、安全性以及不同治疗策略（如ICI组合、供体来源、给药途径）对疗效的影响，为未来临床试验设计提供依据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e9b62844e5031ff35428cc56\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"针对晚期或难治性实体瘤患者，评估粪便微生物群移植（FMT）联合免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的临床疗效与安全性。纳入的研究包括随机对照试验（RCT）、单臂干预研究和前瞻性队列研究，涵盖黑色素瘤、肾细胞癌（RCC）、微卫星稳定型结直肠癌（MSS-CRC）等多种肿瘤类型。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::92021fb9971ea3e4766af23f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"这是一篇系统综述与荟萃分析，旨在综合现有证据以评估FMT作为增强ICI疗效辅助策略的临床价值。研究通过系统检索PubMed及临床试验注册库，筛选出10项涉及164名患者的研究进行定量合成。主要发现显示，FMT联合ICI的总体客观缓解率（ORR）为43%，其中抗PD-1联合抗CTLA-4双药治疗的ORR显著高于单药治疗（60% vs 37%）。安全性方面，1-2级不良事件发生率为42%，3-4级为37%。尽管结果呈现初步积极信号，但作者指出由于纳入研究多为早期小样本试验且缺乏长期随访数据，结论尚需大规模RCT进一步验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3b7b7af558c58a4499ecb4c3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅反映临床终点（ORR/PFS/OS），未直接测量微生物群的具体组成变化与疗效之间的因果链条。异质性较高，不能代表所有患者群体。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了FMT联合ICI在实体瘤中的汇总临床疗效数据（ORR 43%），证实了微生物干预对ICI疗效的正向调节作用。特别指出抗PD-1/CTLA-4双药联合时疗效显著提升（ORR 60%），提示微生物群可能增强双重阻断的协同效应。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::baeffd11973b8117fbd94bc8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些是作者基于已有文献提出的假设，并非本荟萃分析直接验证的机制。缺乏直接的分子生物学证据（如单细胞测序、代谢组学数据）来证实这些机制在FMT患者中的实际运作路径。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了FMT增强ICI疗效的潜在机制假说：(1) 增加有益菌（如Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium）；(2) 提高肠道微生物α多样性；(3) 调节肿瘤微环境（TME），促进效应T细胞浸润并抑制调节性T细胞。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::70a1fbb4ae53658675f13905\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"亚组分析样本量小，异质性大，结果仅为趋势性观察，不能作为确定性的指导原则。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了供体来源（ICI反应者 vs 健康人）和给药途径（口服胶囊 vs 内镜）对疗效的潜在影响趋势，尽管统计上不显著，但提示了个性化FMT策略的重要性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d96c70c917d3a596edfbe6ea\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"1-2级AE发生率42%，3-4级为37%。双药治疗组3-4级AE更高。FMT可能具有减轻某些irAEs（如结肠炎）的潜力。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5e662876d721f40ab5d1373e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"纳入研究多为早期小样本试验，缺乏大规模RCT，长期疗效和安全性未知。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5e8191023314ee620d1ad57b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为荟萃分析，其结论依赖于纳入的10项研究的质量和设计。大部分研究为单臂或小样本RCT，存在较高的选择偏倚风险，因此其报告的疗效提升不能完全归因于FMT，也可能受患者选择等因素影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1203040411132c25753f80e1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"亚组分析（如供体来源、给药途径）的结果虽显示趋势，但因样本量小和异质性高，不具备统计显著性，解读时应谨慎，避免过度推断。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::31cc722c4896a75ea0043c36\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制部分仅为作者基于文献的推测，非本研究直接验证，引用时需明确区分观察性关联与因果机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e1f1f9e8dbb36c4251377288\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study provides detailed safety data (42% grade 1–2 adverse events, 37% grade 3–4 adverse events) and mechanistic hypotheses (e.g., increasing beneficial bacteria like Akkermansia muciniphila, modulating tumor microenvironment) which, while not validating the Phase III gap, offer context on why such trials are being pursued. It also notes heterogeneity in FMT protocols (donor sources, administration routes) as a barrier that large-scale trials need to standardize.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"phase_iii_rct_evidence\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\level2\\\\external\\\\N48436b3aa73aea86f35f-f45b87be8e30256e\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\phase_iii_rct_evidence\\\\attempt-c7j_i2fn\\\\source_units\\\\SU01_search_candidate_d1c4b32e8c\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"The specific evidence requested—completed large-scale randomized controlled Phase III clinical trials confirming efficacy—is not present in the literature covered by this study. The 164 patients across 10 studies do not constitute a large-scale Phase III dataset, and the authors explicitly state the need for such trials to validate efficacy and safety.\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This study is a systematic review and meta-analysis (search up to September 30, 2024) that included 10 studies involving 164 patients with solid tumors treated with FMT combined with ICIs. The authors report that the included studies comprised 5 phase I trials, 4 phase II–III trials, and 3 randomized controlled trials (RCTs), but note that most were early-phase clinical trials with small sample sizes. The pooled objective response rate (ORR) was 43%, with subgroup analysis showing higher ORR (60%) for anti-PD-1 combined with anti-CTLA-4 therapy compared to monotherapy (37%). Crucially, the authors conclude in both the Abstract and Discussion that 'larger-scale randomized controlled trials with long-term follow-up are required to confirm and optimize treatment protocols' and highlight the 'absence of randomized controlled trials' (referring to large-scale/definitive ones) as a limitation. This material directly addresses the gap question by confirming that while preliminary RCT data exists, completed large-scale Phase III evidence is currently lacking and identified as a necessary future step.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5f29fcf1f0241716fc0bbb3d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::153738efad1ff78582447def\",\n          \"snapshot::44b1f3bad783421ccdb817ed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e0cdcaea407050de1d47f292\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::909e9ecd79e01dcc6a3af3bc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ee50190613a56dd7cb60fb52\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究采用文献综述的方法。作者检索并整理了近年来关于肠道微生物群与ICI疗效及毒性关系的研究，重点分析了不同癌症类型中响应者与无响应者/发生irAEs患者之间的微生物组成差异（基于16S rRNA测序和宏基因组测序数据）。文章通过表格汇总了各研究中涉及的细菌门类、属种及其与临床结局的关联，并归纳了相关的代谢机制和动物实验验证结果。最后，综述了FMT及其他微生态调节策略的临床应用现状、局限性及未来方向。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::63dddf9f60b735545758e10e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"系统汇总了不同实体瘤中肠道微生物群与ICI疗效及irAEs关联的现有证据，提供了按癌症类型和微生物门类分类的详细参考表（Table 1, 2, 3, 4, 5），有助于识别潜在的生物标志物。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，其结论依赖于所纳入研究的原始数据质量，而原始研究多为观察性队列，存在混杂因素（如饮食、抗生素使用）和方法学差异。文章未提供新的实验数据，对因果机制的解释主要基于作者对现有文献的综合推断，缺乏大规模前瞻性验证。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cad74e04b48d46bf9fabed2e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"不同实体瘤类型（黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC、HCC等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"厚壁菌门（Firmicutes）和放线菌门（Actinobacteria）中的某些菌种（如双歧杆菌、普拉梭菌）常与ICI疗效正相关；拟杆菌门（Bacteroidetes）的作用具有情境依赖性，部分情况下与疗效负相关或与irAEs相关；变形菌门（Proteobacteria）通常与无响应或较差预后相关；粘质沙雷氏菌（Akkermansia muciniphila）在多种肿瘤中被发现与良好疗效相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b749feba7530e5b0f51c3569\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的发生\",\n          \"finding\": \"irAEs的发生与特定的微生物组成有关。例如，厚壁菌门在某些研究中与高概率的irAEs相关，而在另一些研究中（如肝细胞癌）其高丰度可能具有保护作用。拟杆菌门在某些情况下与严重的irAEs（如结肠炎）相关。变形菌门、酸杆菌门（Acidobacteria）等在irAEs患者中富集。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5a2cae410d9984e50db67838\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"微生物代谢产物\",\n          \"finding\": \"有益代谢物如短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）、多糖A（PSA）、肌苷（inosine）可通过调节T细胞功能、抑制炎症或增强抗肿瘤免疫来促进ICI疗效。有害代谢物如脂多糖（LPS）、氨、酚类物质可能促进免疫逃逸或慢性炎症。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b6f20768b2887d10ea80e7ce\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"粪菌移植（FMT）\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT在小样本临床试验和动物模型中显示出增强ICI疗效（如增加CD8+ T细胞浸润）和缓解难治性ICI相关结肠炎的潜力，但存在感染风险、供体选择异质性和长期效果不确定性等局限。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::831f74c18f6acbb460305b7d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e9ee22d0d649cfdef88dfaa3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究动机在于ICIs虽然显著改善了多种癌症患者的生存率，但响应率低（13%-69%）且伴随不可预测的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。现有证据表明肠道微生物群可能影响这些结果，但具体哪些微生物、通过何种机制影响疗效和毒性尚需系统总结，以便指导临床个性化治疗和开发新的干预策略。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::54e701adaced0c19b2d494e0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在实体瘤治疗中的应用，聚焦于肠道微生物群对疗效和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响，以及粪菌移植（FMT）等干预手段。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c7ad8027bdd3670be2e63b9e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"这是一篇2023年发表的综述文章，旨在探讨肠道微生物群如何调节免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）的疗效和毒性。文章首先介绍了肠道微生物作为“隐藏器官”在维持肠道屏障和免疫监视中的作用，随后系统梳理了不同实体瘤（如转移性黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌、肝细胞癌等）中，特定细菌门类和物种与ICI疗效及irAEs发生的相关性。文章还讨论了微生物代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸、肌苷等）在介导免疫反应中的潜在机制，并总结了通过粪菌移植（FMT）、益生菌、益生元等手段调节肠道菌群以增强疗效或减轻毒性的临床进展与挑战。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6b6fd4c90a28730f2eb6373e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些关联主要基于观察性研究，存在方法学差异和混杂因素，不能直接确立因果关系。不同研究间结果可能存在矛盾（如拟杆菌门的作用），需结合具体研究条件解读。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了不同实体瘤类型中，与ICI疗效（响应/无响应）相关的特定肠道微生物门类及代表性菌种的详细列表。例如，指出厚壁菌门和放线菌门中的某些菌常与疗效正相关，而变形菌门常与无响应相关。同时列出了与irAEs发生相关的微生物特征。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e9ef9bbe1d07e4fa2b50d933\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制部分主要基于文献综述和动物模型，人类体内的确切分子通路仍需更多临床验证。作者提出的机制解释属于理论推测，尚未完全证实。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"概述了微生物影响ICI疗效和毒性的潜在机制，包括微生物代谢产物（如SCFAs、肌苷、多糖A）对免疫系统（如T细胞分化、炎症反应）的调节作用，以及动物实验中微生物干预对肿瘤微环境的影响。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::839eaa8272d598a3ac783d7b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"介绍了肠道微生物群的基本生理功能（维持肠道屏障、免疫监视）及其作为‘隐藏器官’的重要性，以及ICIs治疗的现状和挑战（响应率低、irAEs频发）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1e562fd41ff771a831aa787e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"总结了FMT、益生菌、益生元、合生元等调节肠道微生物群的临床和非临床干预手段，包括其应用形式、潜在益处（如增强疗效、缓解结肠炎）和风险（如感染、定植失败）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::412037d056deaf7ee693f762\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提到了用于分析肠道微生物的技术（16S rRNA测序、宏基因组测序）及其优缺点。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8050f7606cc859cf0734ef4a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述包含的观察性关联结果受限于原始研究的样本量、人群异质性和分析方法，不同研究间可能存在矛盾结论，需谨慎解读。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f042c5c41db8a7f21ac56a22\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的机制多为基于文献的综合推断或动物实验结果，不能直接等同于人体内的确证机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bb0879b11b5a1b10da7c7aef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"FMT的临床应用仍处于早期阶段，小样本研究和个案报道较多，其长期安全性和有效性尚未得到大规模随机对照试验的充分验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::86b10cb569ea8ac64321c19f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"微生物与疗效/毒性的关联具有癌症类型特异性，不能简单外推至所有实体瘤。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1ef07c70664910505cf59320\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0231\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-cf2fc9e893310420ac34\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0eb61fe9830b1063300638cd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e36852e039a578ad56dc1947\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bfaa65a3320dc440ddff00ad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The authors conducted a narrative synthesis of existing literature. They categorized findings into potential benefits (positive clinical responses in melanoma, CRC, etc.) and failures (e.g., SER-401 trial). Mechanisms were analyzed through host physiology alterations (microbiota diversity/composition, metabolites like SCFAs and bile acids, TME immune cell infiltration, signaling pathways). Optimization strategies were derived from donor screening criteria, functional vs. composition-based selection, and monitoring methods. Future perspectives were outlined based on identified gaps in current knowledge.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::95ea94d27b2d7b2268bfea91\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides a structured overview of the heterogeneous clinical outcomes of FMT-ICI combination therapy across different cancer types.\",\n          \"limits\": \"As a narrative review, it does not present new primary data or perform a systematic quantitative meta-analysis; conclusions are based on synthesized observations from cited studies.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::450a76879e9b6be3204aedb4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Elucidates complex, multi-level mechanisms linking gut microbiota to ICI response, highlighting both beneficial and detrimental pathways.\",\n          \"limits\": \"Many mechanistic insights are derived from preclinical models or small clinical cohorts; causal relationships in humans require further validation.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9b598e37442cf0b01ffd531d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Identifies critical variables (donor selection, recipient status, protocol details) that contribute to outcome variability.\",\n          \"limits\": \"Standardized protocols for donor selection and FMT administration are not yet established, limiting direct clinical translation recommendations.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::11c4feb5b5ae93fe26823491\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"In responders to anti-PD-1 therapy (e.g., melanoma, MSS-mCRC)\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT increases gut microbial diversity and enriches beneficial taxa (e.g., Bifidobacterium, Faecalibacterium), leading to enhanced CD8+ T cell infiltration, reduced immunosuppressive cells (Tregs, MDSCs), and improved clinical outcomes.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::77f7f442b2ee33b41d52bb77\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"In non-responders or specific trials (e.g., NCT03817125 with SER-401)\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT or defined bacterial formulations may fail to improve or even worsen outcomes, potentially due to the expansion of immunosuppressive cells, activation of resistance pathways, or introduction of harmful metabolites/bacteria.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2c7718994e5ccb908e7d025e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Mechanistic level\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT modulates ICI efficacy via multiple pathways: altering microbiota composition/diversity, producing metabolites (SCFAs can be both beneficial and immunosuppressive; bile acids like DCA can promote tumor growth), reshaping the TME (increasing effector T cells, decreasing suppressive myeloid cells), and modulating signaling pathways (TLR, Wnt/β-catenin).\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cd8d7b2aff300bc3e39abfe6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2f7f34d1e2f3b372fe06493a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"To address the inconsistency in clinical outcomes when combining FMT with ICIs, elucidate the underlying mechanisms of this interaction, identify key factors influencing efficacy, and provide a framework for optimizing FMT strategies to enhance immunotherapy response.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::307ba8b829e2c5c2fed7647d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review focuses on the integration of fecal microbiota transplantation (FMT) with immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) for cancer treatment. It covers clinical evidence from various solid tumors (melanoma, colorectal cancer, etc.), preclinical mechanistic studies, and optimization strategies for FMT protocols.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1bdd4c29ead36b61ef77d66e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This is a comprehensive narrative review that critically examines the controversial effects of combining FMT with ICIs. It synthesizes evidence from clinical trials and preclinical studies to explain why FMT sometimes enhances ICI efficacy while other times shows no benefit or adverse effects. The paper outlines mechanisms involving gut microbiota modulation, metabolite profiles, and tumor microenvironment changes, and discusses factors influencing outcomes such as donor selection, recipient characteristics, and administration protocols. It concludes by proposing future research directions including large-scale trials, multi-omics integration, and alternative microbiome-based therapies.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5013ece2973d969d51eb7c45\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"Evidence is drawn from various trial phases and tumor types; generalizations across all solid tumors should be cautious due to varying baseline microbiomes and tumor immunogenicity.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Summarizes clinical evidence showing that FMT can enhance ICI efficacy in specific solid tumors (melanoma, MSS-mCRC) by correlating with increased microbial diversity and beneficial taxa enrichment. Also reports cases where FMT failed or showed adverse effects.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::07684cdaa7711484a96a6e52\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"Some mechanisms are primarily supported by preclinical mouse models; human validation is ongoing. The dual role of certain metabolites (e.g., SCFAs) means effects are context-dependent.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Details specific mechanisms: 1) Modulation of gut microbiota diversity/composition affecting T cell function. 2) Metabolite-mediated effects (SCFAs enhancing CD8+ T cells but also promoting Tregs; bile acids promoting tumor growth). 3) TME remodeling (increased CD8+ T cells, decreased Tregs/MDSCs). 4) Signaling pathway modulation (TLR, Wnt/β-catenin).\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2226fca183a362e244126599\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Comparison of FMT with other microbiome interventions (prebiotics, postbiotics, defined consortia) and discussion of alternatives like SER-401 and MET4.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::21da90be60b5d73d7b8ff795\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Discussion on regulatory frameworks, donor screening standards, and long-term safety assessments.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dd15735166da05292e878072\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review covers multiple cancer types, not exclusively solid tumors; ensure relevance to the user's focus on solid tumors is maintained.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9bcc0d92e9bead3c890478c5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Mechanistic claims often rely on preclinical data; distinguish between observed associations in humans and proposed mechanisms from animal models.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::31c84a6ae14740360e96957e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The term 'controversial' reflects mixed results; avoid interpreting negative results as definitive proof of inefficacy without considering confounding factors (donor, protocol, patient status).\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b24a190d28e263126fc08053\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7370217b0d1083d4f465a9fd\",\n          \"snapshot::b8f4ede79d64928928c3569c\",\n          \"snapshot::d1590c0e09f64bdeb0f7b69b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f4b7a011c024ad35d6069b6d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9e8d2afae6df0c8cfa6d162b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::02d4f3869584b2c56ccee6e0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用叙事性综述方法，按主题组织材料：1) 病理机制：分类介绍主要致病菌株的分子通路；2) 保护机制：阐述有益菌群及代谢物的稳态维持功能；3) 诊断应用：汇总近期宏基因组学筛查研究的性能指标（AUC等）及局限性分析；4) 治疗干预：对比不同微生物调控策略（饮食、益生菌、FMT、工程菌、抗生素）的临床前与临床证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::27d8cc82223dec8a7d4e30c3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了结直肠癌相关微生物致病机制的系统性分类框架，明确了病原体与宿主免疫/代谢通路的交互细节。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究，未提供新的实验数据；对临床转化的建议基于现有证据等级的综合判断，而非独立验证。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::69a1e63a269f3d3724cd3d24\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"指出了微生物标志物研究中混杂因素（如BMI、粪便特征）的重要性，强调了定量分析和去混杂的必要性。\",\n          \"limits\": \"未提供具体的去混杂统计模型代码或通用阈值，仅引用了相关研究案例。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1affb32e9d447dd1640b7c70\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"区分了不同微生物治疗策略的证据层级，明确将FMT和工程菌定位为实验性干预，纠正了过度乐观的临床预期。\",\n          \"limits\": \"对于特定菌株在人类患者中的长期定植效果和安全性数据，材料指出尚不充分。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::344ed44b6a8ee6e231c65c61\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"针对具核梭杆菌 (Fn)、pks+大肠杆菌、ETBF等主要病原体\",\n          \"finding\": \"这些菌株通过激活Wnt/β-catenin、NF-κB等信号通路，诱导DNA损伤、慢性炎症及免疫抑制，直接促进肿瘤发生和进展。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::262633b63da28457073bd1c3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"针对基于粪便宏基因组学的CRC筛查模型\",\n          \"finding\": \"多队列荟萃分析显示宏基因组面板具有高诊断效能（AUC 0.85-0.99），但部分关联信号受肠道转运时间、炎症状态等宿主因素混杂，去混杂后某些标志物（如Fn）的关联性减弱。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3b21a9898ddc6755867ded4a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"针对FMT及其他微生物疗法\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT在黑色素瘤等实体瘤中改善免疫检查点抑制剂疗效有初步证据，但在CRC中仅限小规模无对照试验，存在安全性和生态稳定性风险；益生菌和工程菌主要处于临床前阶段；抗生素暴露与CRC风险增加相关，不建议作为预防或治疗手段。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::586c75ce90ada545dd3a5560\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::740021f66edd4876cdcd806a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"旨在澄清肠道微生物组在结直肠癌中从“旁观者”到“主动驱动者”的角色转变，评估当前基于微生物组的诊断 biomarkers 和治疗手段的临床证据水平、主要障碍及未来转化方向。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3c5d20c7ff13df6e2d4bc544\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"结直肠癌（CRC）与肠道微生物组的关系，涵盖致癌机制、保护性菌群功能、基于微生物组的生物标志物开发及临床治疗策略。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3c49fb77560c87b3639984ff\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，系统梳理了肠道微生物组在结直肠癌发生发展中的主动驱动作用及其临床转化潜力。文章首先详细阐述了多种病原体（如具核梭杆菌、pks+大肠杆菌等）通过炎症、代谢紊乱、基因毒性和免疫逃逸促进肿瘤发生的分子机制，并介绍了有益菌群及其代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸）的保护作用。随后，文章评估了基于粪便宏基因组学的生物标志物研究进展，指出其在早期检测中的高准确性但面临标准化和混杂因素控制的挑战。最后，综述了饮食调节、益生菌、粪菌移植（FMT）及工程菌等治疗策略的证据等级，强调目前多数疗法仍处于实验或早期临床阶段，且抗生素使用可能增加风险。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fd0eb3a18c55d9853ec4173a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"主要证据来自结直肠癌的体外/体内模型或小规模观察性研究；FMT在CRC中的有效性尚未在随机对照试验中证实；不同肿瘤类型（如黑色素瘤 vs CRC）的微生物效应可能存在差异，不可直接外推。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了微生物组调节免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的具体实例和证据等级。明确指出Fn和Pa与抗PD-1治疗抵抗相关，而某些益生菌（如Bifidobacterium）在动物模型中增强ICI疗效。FMT在黑色素瘤中恢复ICI响应的临床证据被引用，但在CRC中仅为探索性试验。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::be7b29635f6a16bdd8933ea3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制描述多为细胞或动物模型层面的因果推断；人类体内确切的因果链条仍需更多验证；不同菌株亚型（如Fn的不同clades）可能有不同效应。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了微生物影响免疫微环境的分子机制。包括：1) Fn通过Fap2结合TIGIT抑制T/NK细胞毒性；2) Pa通过TLR2/4激活MDSC抑制CD8+/CD4+ T细胞；3) ETBF诱导Th17/IL-17炎症反应；4) 有益菌代谢物（SCFAs）调节树突状细胞/T细胞反应。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::79bf3738d17eb91a186a0929\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"概述了CRC相关病原体的致病途径（炎症、基因毒性、屏障破坏）及有益菌群的稳态维持作用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::04470712a4e868aed6e5a444\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"讨论了宏基因组学筛查的性能、混杂因素（如粪便特征、BMI）的影响及标准化的必要性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::625c8058d22b46de7c74f8ed\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作者将FMT在CRC中的应用严格限定为‘实验性/临床试验阶段’，不得将其解读为已确立的标准治疗。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::de32431f9f0e93cf811a62f0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的抗生素与CRC风险增加的相关性是流行病学观察结果，不能直接推导为因果关系用于个体临床决策，且明确反对将抗生素作为CRC治疗策略。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dc7c65adbb520124d0718826\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"不同研究中对微生物标志物的定义和检测方法差异巨大，综述中引用的AUC值仅在各自研究背景下有效，跨研究比较需谨慎。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4e77eeb9be6a66e0506c2508\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制描述多基于小鼠模型或细胞实验，人类体内的确切效力和剂量效应尚不明确。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c5efaf95afdbe689eb05eceb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"The review details mechanistic pathways linking specific gut microbes to immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) response, which provides biological rationale for ongoing trials. For example, Fusobacterium nucleatum (Fn) is described as promoting immune evasion via Fap2-TIGIT binding and chemotherapy resistance, while Peptostreptococcus anaerobius (Pa) is linked to anti–PD-1 resistance via MDSC activation. Conversely, beneficial bacteria like Bifidobacterium are noted in preclinical models to enhance antitumor efficacy of PD-1 blockade. The authors also discuss confounding factors in microbiome research (e.g., stool transit time, BMI) that complicate biomarker and intervention standardization, relevant for designing future rigorous trials.\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"phase_iii_rct_evidence\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\level2\\\\external\\\\N48436b3aa73aea86f35f-f45b87be8e30256e\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\phase_iii_rct_evidence\\\\attempt-c7j_i2fn\\\\source_units\\\\SU02_search_candidate_a86301e06d\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"The specific evidence requested—a completed large randomized controlled Phase III clinical trial confirming microbiome intervention efficacy in ICI-treated solid tumors—is not present in this material. The authors explicitly state that such well-controlled prospective studies are still needed and that current human evidence is limited to Phase 1 (melanoma) or uncontrolled Phase 2 (CRC) settings. Therefore, the gap regarding confirmed Phase III efficacy remains unresolved based on this text.\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"unmet\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"This review explicitly addresses the current clinical evidence level for microbiome interventions in cancer immunotherapy. The authors report that for Fecal Microbiota Transplantation (FMT), the most developed clinical evidence comes from Phase 1 studies in melanoma patients showing recovery of anti–PD-1 response in some cases. For colorectal cancer (CRC), the authors cite a Phase 2 study evaluating FMT with immunotherapy and targeted therapy that reported improvement signals but was designed without a control group, making effectiveness determination difficult. The authors conclude that large-scale prospective studies and well-designed randomized controlled trials are still needed before routine clinical use, and frame FMT in CRC as an investigational intervention rather than an established treatment.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ab87732a518d6e5a2a8290c4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"The review details mechanistic pathways linking specific gut microbes to immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) response, which provides biological rationale for ongoing trials. For example, Fusobacterium nucleatum (Fn) is described as promoting immune evasion via Fap2-TIGIT binding and chemotherapy resistance, while Peptostreptococcus anaerobius (Pa) is linked to anti–PD-1 resistance via MDSC activation. Conversely, beneficial bacteria like Bifidobacterium are noted in preclinical models to enhance antitumor efficacy of PD-1 blockade. The authors also discuss confounding factors in microbiome research (e.g., stool transit time, BMI) that complicate biomarker and intervention standardization, relevant for designing future rigorous trials.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"phase_iii_rct_evidence\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\level2\\\\external\\\\N48436b3aa73aea86f35f-f45b87be8e30256e\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\phase_iii_rct_evidence\\\\attempt-c7j_i2fn\\\\source_units\\\\SU02_search_candidate_a86301e06d\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"The specific evidence requested—a completed large randomized controlled Phase III clinical trial confirming microbiome intervention efficacy in ICI-treated solid tumors—is not present in this material. The authors explicitly state that such well-controlled prospective studies are still needed and that current human evidence is limited to Phase 1 (melanoma) or uncontrolled Phase 2 (CRC) settings. Therefore, the gap regarding confirmed Phase III efficacy remains unresolved based on this text.\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This review explicitly addresses the current clinical evidence level for microbiome interventions in cancer immunotherapy. The authors report that for Fecal Microbiota Transplantation (FMT), the most developed clinical evidence comes from Phase 1 studies in melanoma patients showing recovery of anti–PD-1 response in some cases. For colorectal cancer (CRC), the authors cite a Phase 2 study evaluating FMT with immunotherapy and targeted therapy that reported improvement signals but was designed without a control group, making effectiveness determination difficult. The authors conclude that large-scale prospective studies and well-designed randomized controlled trials are still needed before routine clinical use, and frame FMT in CRC as an investigational intervention rather than an established treatment.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ca0e2babfeb778230bdea724\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b027266378a52b2c51ee323b\",\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::062bc64b066bba27e4d94680\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0590\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ee1ea13dd08d157b2c4c0b78\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::561756f2bbd2b70b37b363ad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f8d46076dbce31aaac161ee9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::db7a8435ac609db0d12fd3fc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"遵循PRISMA指南进行系统综述。在Medline数据库中搜索“cancer immunotherapy”或“immune checkpoint inhibitors”与“microbiome”、“probiotic”、“antibiotic”、“dysbiosis”的组合词。纳入标准为英语或法语出版物，描述可量化的微生物组组成/修饰与ICI反应或irAEs之间的联系。排除综述、评论和专家意见（但筛查其参考文献）。数据提取变量包括患者数量、ICI类型、癌症类型、微生物组评估方法、干预措施及量化效应。未进行定量合成（Meta分析），而是进行定性综合。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a372f35d37fbc9e9ab705838\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了截至2018年底关于肠道微生物组如何影响ICI疗效和毒性的临床证据的综合视图。确认了抗生素使用的负面影响，并指出了特定微生物特征（如多样性、特定菌属比例）与疗效的潜在联系。\",\n          \"limits\": \"仅检索Medline数据库，可能遗漏其他来源的研究。纳入的研究多为回顾性、样本量小且异质性高，缺乏前瞻性试验数据。未能确定具体的因果机制，且无法精确定义抗生素暴露的最佳时间窗口或优先避免的抗生素类别。所给摘要未交代具体的统计学检验细节及偏倚风险评估过程。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b3fb5721262e723c91289978\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"实体瘤患者（NSCLC, RCC为主），接受ICI治疗前后使用抗生素（ABt组 vs ABn组）\",\n          \"finding\": \"抗生素使用与较低的ICI疗效相关。在RCC患者中，抗生素显著缩短PFS和OS，降低ORR；在NSCLC患者中，抗生素显著降低OS，但对PFS和ORR的影响不一致或无显著差异。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::67cace238a913bff89cc5bbd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"不同癌症类型（黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC、SCCHN），基线粪便或唾液样本\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物组组成与ICI疗效存在显著关联，但具体细菌物种在不同研究中不一致（如Bifidobacterium longum, Akkermansia muciniphila, Ruminococcaceae等）。高细菌多样性和“响应者相关”细菌与“非响应者相关”细菌的良好比例似乎与更好的患者预后相关。口腔微生物组与ICI疗效无明显关联。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::636297537a64ff7d48ea6f38\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"黑色素瘤患者，接受Ipilimumab治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物组组成与irAEs（特别是结肠炎）的发生相关。某些细菌（如Faecalibacterium prausnitzii）的高丰度与结肠炎风险增加相关，而其他细菌（如Bacteroidetes）的高丰度则与低发生率相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bb85bf7cf3b7520e42bac278\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI诱导的难治性结肠炎患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"在两例个案报告中，粪便微生物群移植（FMT）成功缓解了ICI相关的结肠炎症状。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9fccf1f92e02624214751276\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7d394b023c0e359555818e62\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管前体模型显示肠道微生物组显著影响ICI疗效，但在临床实践中这种相互作用尚不清楚。本研究试图确定：(1)抗生素是否影响ICI疗效；(2)基线微生物组组成是否与ICI疗效相关；(3)基线微生物组组成是否与irAEs发生相关；(4)微生物组操纵是否能减轻irAEs。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::36d86217c97658464f951139\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"人类实体瘤患者（主要为非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌、黑色素瘤等）接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括抗CTLA-4、抗PD-1和抗PD-L1抗体）治疗期间，肠道微生物组（GM）及其修饰（如抗生素使用、粪便微生物群移植FMT）对ICI疗效及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::43d061a73b3a3eae2757344b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"这是一篇2019年发表的系统综述，旨在评估临床实践中肠道微生物组与免疫检查点抑制剂疗效之间的关联。作者通过Medline检索，筛选出13项符合纳入标准的人类研究（包括全文文章和摘要），分别分析了抗生素使用对ICI疗效的影响、基线微生物组组成与ICI疗效的相关性、以及微生物组组成与irAEs（特别是结肠炎）的相关性。研究发现抗生素使用普遍与ICI疗效降低相关，而特定的微生物组成或多样性与更好的临床结局有关；此外，FMT在个别案例中显示出缓解ICI诱导的结肠炎的潜力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8110bf0dfeccd06b176b388b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述结论建议尽可能避免在ICI治疗前或使用期间使用抗生素，因为其对ICI抗癌疗效有负面影响。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1ec1d115dbdccbaa73d52394\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"FMT在动物模型中恢复ICI疗效并减少结肠炎，在人类个案中成功缓解难治性结肠炎，但尚无改善ICI疗效的人体数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::adfa7bd48f577f29787929e6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"口腔微生物组与ICI疗效无明显关联，而肠道微生物组有显著关联。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::87be9dc5c374268b1a03bb40\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"相关性不等于因果性；具体菌种的预测价值在不同研究中存在冲突，不能直接确立单一通用生物标志物。样本量较小，多为回顾性研究。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了抗生素使用与ICI疗效降低之间关联的多项临床研究汇总，包括ORR、PFS和OS的具体变化趋势。同时列举了不同癌症类型中微生物组组成与疗效关联的具体菌种（如Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium等），尽管这些菌种在不同研究中不一致。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d5efbdf228428548df85d84f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些主要是基于动物模型或观察性数据的推测，文中明确指出人类患者中尚未进行类似的机制验证研究。无法直接证明具体的分子机制路径。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"讨论了抗生素可能通过改变微生物组选择不利菌种、或通过抗生素本身的抗炎特性（如降低促炎细胞因子、减少T细胞反应）来拮抗ICI疗效的潜在机制。指出微生物组与irAEs（结肠炎）的关联可能反映了ICI疗效与免疫介导毒性之间的正相关（表型伴随现象）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::404a9ca12df1963abbc87e35\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述主要涵盖实体瘤，特别是NSCLC、RCC和黑色素瘤，结果可能不适用于血液肿瘤或其他类型癌症。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::53a0bd3fb171b371a2478ce7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"关于特定细菌物种与疗效的关联在不同研究中存在不一致，这可能与检测方法、人群特征和医疗史差异有关，需谨慎解读单一菌种的预测价值。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8297157472470af83f1bc39c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"抗生素的影响可能是多方面的（微生物组改变+直接抗炎作用），综述未区分具体抗生素种类的影响差异，仅指出广谱抗生素影响更显著。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5d67a3c8f18f37b7d08c0079\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"FMT在缓解irAEs中的效果仅基于个案报告，不能推广为常规治疗建议。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::45e41b4fe5fb9a4f54bf481a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"pdf\",\n              \"reason\": \"full-page text extracted; page positions retained\",\n              \"status\": \"fitz\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"fitz\",\n              \"reason\": \"layout, table relations, formulas, figure pixels, and scanned text may be lost\",\n              \"status\": \"known_gap\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c1380d633739b6409c09a4c3\",\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\",\n          \"snapshot::1fd227bf27d6d15554f9ced9\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6876a7672a4e8cc10ed58a9e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::5b707a9c2a4912437225849f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f64b86f6332b5b10d7912848\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4b5f2a4e583d5e334c8406ba\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e375dcfa704548e4e1e2ce18\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作为一篇综述，本研究通过系统检索PubMed和Google Scholar数据库（关键词包括“gut microbiome and host immunity”等），筛选2011-2021年间发表的相关文献。内容综合分为三个主要部分：(1) 机制综述：从分子和细胞水平描述微生物-宿主免疫互作网络；(2) 临床转化综述：汇总关于FMT、益生菌、益生元及饮食干预的临床试验结果（引用Table 1列出具体试验）；(3) 批判性分析：讨论现有研究的局限性、安全性问题及未来方向。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::699ce05cd5b6d1ea0619d0b3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效的多维度机制框架（从黏膜屏障到全身免疫及TME重塑）；系统梳理了多种微生物干预策略（FMT、益生菌、益生元、饮食）的临床前及早期临床试验数据；指出了当前研究在标准化测序、供体选择及安全性方面的关键瓶颈。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究，未进行新的实验验证；所引用的临床试验多为早期阶段（I/II期）或小样本，疗效证据尚不充分；不同研究间因队列差异、测序方法不同导致的结果不一致性未被完全解决；对于具体菌株或代谢物的因果机制，部分仍基于动物模型或观察性关联，缺乏大规模随机对照试验的确证。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::598e775f94110c1118942162\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"机制层面\",\n          \"finding\": \"肠道微生物通过PRRs识别PAMPs激活先天免疫；通过GALT组织诱导Treg/Th17分化及SIgA产生；代谢物如SCFAs可进入循环调节全身免疫及TME中的巨噬细胞/DC功能；存在抗原交叉反应机制，针对细菌抗原的T细胞可能激活抗肿瘤反应。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b9c08ebf69f13f06d0cf38c6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"FMT干预\",\n          \"finding\": \"临床前显示FMT可将非响应者微生物转移给无菌小鼠从而恢复PD-1疗效；临床试验（如NCT03353402, NCT03341143）显示FMT联合PD-1抑制剂可使部分难治性黑色素瘤患者获得客观缓解，并改变肠道及肿瘤微环境的免疫细胞浸润。但存在严重不良事件风险（如耐药菌感染、死亡）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6a1935c1fa786f0d5c27a8ee\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"益生菌/菌群制剂\",\n          \"finding\": \"特定菌株（如Bifidobacterium, Lactobacillus）联合ICI治疗在某些癌症（如肾癌、NSCLC）的临床试验中显示出改善ORR/PFS的趋势；某些菌株（如Blautia obeum）与不良预后或结肠炎风险增加相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::522c1a8223671dc609d86668\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"益生元/饮食\",\n          \"finding\": \"抗性淀粉（RS）等益生元促进有益菌生长及SCFA产生，增强化疗/放疗疗效并降低炎症因子；高纤维饮食与黑色素瘤患者更好的PD-1响应率相关；嘌呤核苷肌苷（Inosine）被鉴定为改善ICI疗效的关键代谢物。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::364b743ad363cbb93437d55d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::139e6b53b9edcfaa318dc0e4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"1. 肠道微生物组如何影响宿主免疫系统及抗肿瘤免疫？2. 肠道微生物组的组成和功能如何解释患者对ICIs治疗的异质性反应？3. 有哪些策略可以调节肠道微生物群以提高ICIs的疗效或减轻毒性？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f13f4ff62bafa7356cc1fc5d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"肠道微生物组（Gut microbiome）与宿主免疫系统及癌症的相互作用，特别是其对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效的影响。涵盖机制探讨（先天/适应性免疫、肿瘤微环境）及干预策略（FMT、益生菌、益生元、饮食/生活方式）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::243c66c5adc1973443e09f34\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在总结肠道微生物组在调节宿主免疫和癌症治疗反应中的最新知识。文章首先阐述了肠道微生物如何通过局部和全身途径影响宿主免疫系统（包括先天性和适应性免疫），并进一步讨论其在肿瘤微环境（TME）中对抗肿瘤免疫的作用。随后，文章评估了通过粪便微生物移植（FMT）、益生菌、益生元以及饮食和生活方式改变来调节肠道微生物群以改善ICIs疗效的临床前证据和临床试验进展，并讨论了相关的安全性和未来挑战。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::98b5ea781331e8ac5aa78af9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"所引用的临床试验多为早期探索性研究，样本量小，且结果存在异质性。不能直接推断所有微生物干预均有效，需结合其他研究确认特定菌株或策略的普适性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效的具体干预策略及其临床现状。列举了FMT、益生菌（如V9, M9）、益生元（RS）及饮食（高纤维、发酵大豆）在多种实体瘤（黑色素瘤、肺癌、肠癌等）中的临床试验结果（引用Table 1）。指出高纤维饮食与PD-1响应率正相关，特定益生菌联合治疗可能改善ORR。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e09623aeb4d97eb72cc38807\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"许多机制细节（如具体的交叉反应肽段、Inosine的确切受体通路）主要基于动物模型（无菌小鼠、人源化小鼠）或体外研究。在人类患者中的直接因果证据仍在积累中，综述本身未提供新的机制验证数据。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了微生物调节ICI疗效的潜在生物学机制。包括：1) 局部免疫：通过PRRs激活先天免疫，诱导Treg/Th17分化及SIgA产生；2) 全身免疫：代谢物（SCFAs, BAs, Inosine）进入循环调节免疫细胞；3) 肿瘤微环境：通过抗原交叉反应（Cross-reactivity）激活抗肿瘤T细胞，或通过细胞因子（TNFα, IL-12等）重塑TME。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bfead1d510827947a5ceff6b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"介绍了肠道微生物组与宿主免疫系统的复杂互作网络，包括GALT组织、DCs、T细胞亚群（Treg, Th17）的功能及代谢物（SCFAs, AMPs）的作用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9022ab3593d8b05c04816d74\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"指出当前领域面临的挑战：患者队列差异大、测序方法不统一（16S vs WGS）、参考数据库差异、FMT的安全性风险（耐药菌传播）、以及外源性因素（抗生素、饮食）的干扰。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4b778fc535f5dec927356858\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提到了Blautia obeum与ICI结肠炎风险增加相关，Bacteroides具有双重效应；FDA关于FMT严重不良事件的警告。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f1dc219a31203b26acd60013\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述涵盖多种癌症类型（黑色素瘤、肺癌、肠癌、肝癌等），在应用于特定固体瘤时需注意疾病特异性的差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e591d4549916c26e538570d0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的临床疗效数据主要来自早期临床试验，效力证据等级有限，不可将其视为确证的临床指南。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::51e616dcfef51397e963d6e4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制部分大量依赖动物模型推论，在人类身上的适用性需谨慎评估，特别是涉及具体菌株或代谢物的因果链条。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9b84e59ce8543ac4eeb0010e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"不同研究间的微生物组分析方法和定义可能存在差异，直接比较具体菌属丰度时需考虑技术偏差。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8cd1fc7eec45f6d5282bc5d2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b4fe98bf4129f2a01928c2de\",\n          \"snapshot::49f12e61cfb8da920f6cf528\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d6eee809d3a5fb9398bc336e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2bf4fe63f420d8b697f638a7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::195234883ee2c22f9c7f65b8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用统一的操作框架（Microbiome → Metabolites → Immune Modulation → TME State → ICI Response）进行综合。首先从机制层面分析微生物代谢物（SCFAs、胆汁酸、色氨酸衍生物、多胺）对适应性免疫细胞（CD8+ T细胞、Treg、Th1/Th17）和固有免疫效应细胞（巨噬细胞、DC、NK细胞）的重编程作用。其次，回顾2015-2018年 landmark 临床研究及后续FMT概念验证试验，评估微生物组成与ICI预后的关联。最后，基于证据等级（观察性数据 vs. 随机对照试验缺失、样本量限制、技术异质性）对FMT、益生菌、饮食干预及下一代微生物制剂进行转化潜力和临床就绪度评估。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2185cc3f8d466cf3b2e9e28c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了一个统一的机制-临床整合框架，明确了肠道微生物组通过代谢物介导的TME重编程路径。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略、纳入排除标准及偏倚风险评估方法。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e3b16c024dc89bf6c3b836ae\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"澄清了SCFAs作用的上下文依赖性（Context-dependent），解释了其在不同微环境中的双重角色，纠正了盲目补充的误区。\",\n          \"limits\": \"关于SCFAs在人体肿瘤中的确切浓度-反应关系尚不明确，所给材料未提供具体的人体肿瘤内SCFA浓度数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dce060fe112e7c5c200443c9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"批判性地评估了微生物组生物标志物的临床就绪度，指出了技术异质性、缺乏前瞻性验证和地理差异等关键局限。\",\n          \"limits\": \"结论基于已发表的观察性和小规模干预研究，尚未包含大规模多中心前瞻性验证结果。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e0b9df36406c4784f1e045e1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"为临床实践提供了分层建议：立即实施抗生素管理，谨慎对待饮食/益生菌，严格限制FMT于临床试验。\",\n          \"limits\": \"这些建议主要基于观察性关联和小规模概念验证研究，缺乏大型随机对照试验的直接证据支持所有干预措施。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::97fe898ec59111e2c6a2b1fb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"在健康黏膜稳态下\",\n          \"finding\": \"SCFAs促进Foxp3+ Treg分化，维持黏膜免疫稳态。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::99a1b5aa57e1a934b35e704d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"在肿瘤免疫微环境中（IFN-γ高表达），且浓度适宜时\",\n          \"finding\": \"SCFAs增强CD8+ T细胞功能（降低PD-1/TIM-3/LAG-3表达）并促进M1型巨噬细胞极化，具有抗肿瘤免疫促进作用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cef29ad0d40807f5c4be0301\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"盲法补充SCFA或高剂量纤维，未考虑肿瘤免疫表型和基线微生物组状态\",\n          \"finding\": \"缺乏临床支持，可能无效或产生矛盾效果。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7b46ba1efa0ccf7ee2e70db2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"黑色素瘤和NSCLC患者中\",\n          \"finding\": \"较高的肠道微生物多样性及特定菌属（如Faecalibacterium prausnitzii, Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium longum）富集与更好的ICI预后相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d6b776dc4db8bded3cc7ef35\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"接受ICI治疗的晚期黑色素瘤耐药患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"来自ICI响应者的FMT可部分逆转ICI耐药（概念验证阶段），伴随肿瘤内CD8+ T细胞浸润增加。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e451d2eb6eaaa774d9144e9f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI治疗前后30-60天内使用广谱抗生素\",\n          \"finding\": \"与较短的无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）一致相关，支持抗生素管理，但存在混杂因素（疾病严重程度）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0d6057781943de584e9cf1f2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"商业益生菌使用\",\n          \"finding\": \"观察性数据显示可能与较差的PFS趋势相关，不支持常规推荐。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5338ed7691dfb4a70f43c749\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::400987067f9112654469f325\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管ICI改变了多种恶性肿瘤的治疗格局，但持久响应率仍然有限。需要厘清肠道微生物组作为系统性免疫调节因子，如何通过代谢产物重塑肿瘤微环境（TME）从而影响ICI疗效；同时需要评估将微生物组特征转化为临床预测生物标志物或治疗策略的可行性与局限性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::89c40541a350639004f2a39b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"聚焦肠道微生物组（gut microbiome）对实体瘤免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，如抗PD-1/PD-L1、抗CTLA-4）疗效的系统性调节作用。明确排除肿瘤内微生物组（intratumoral microbiome），主要涵盖黑色素瘤和非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）等实体瘤的临床与机制证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4eb0ae361131e5d9242f99aa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在整合肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效的机制证据与临床发现。文章提出并应用“微生物组→代谢物→免疫调节→TME状态→ICI反应”的统一操作框架，系统梳理了短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）、次级胆汁酸、色氨酸代谢物和多胺等关键代谢轴的作用机制。同时，文章批判性地评估了现有临床关联研究、粪菌移植（FMT）概念验证试验及饮食/益生菌干预的证据等级，指出目前尚无经临床验证的生物标志物，并基于当前证据为临床医生提供了抗生素管理、饮食建议及实验性疗法使用的具体指导原则。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7922c614bdcb79bda3feb1d5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制描述主要基于前临床模型（小鼠）和部分人类体外/体内观察，部分人体内的确切浓度-效应关系未知。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了四种主要代谢轴（SCFAs、胆汁酸、色氨酸、多胺）的具体分子机制。包括SCFAs通过HDAC抑制和GPCR信号通路调节T细胞耗竭和巨噬细胞极化；色氨酸代谢中宿主IDO酶与细菌吲哚途径的竞争；胆汁酸受体信号对T细胞的抑制；以及多胺对髓系细胞的免疫抑制作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eb76630b77251fb97c0e9d0a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"证据主要来自黑色素瘤和NSCLC，其他实体瘤数据较少；相关性不等于因果性；生物标志物尚未 validated。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"总结了关键临床观察：特定菌群（F. prausnitzii, A. muciniphila, B. longum）与ICI响应正相关；抗生素使用与预后不良相关；FMT在概念验证研究中显示部分逆转耐药的潜力。同时指出了这些发现的局限性（回顾性设计、小样本、技术异质性）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4f161335a98ee48efcf29983\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"基于现有小规模研究和专家共识，缺乏大型RCT证据支持所有干预措施的长期安全性和有效性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"评估了转化策略的临床就绪度：FMT处于早期试验阶段，需标准化供体和监管批准；商业益生菌可能有害，不建议常规使用；高纤维饮食可作为健康优化建议，但非特异性抗癌治疗。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::399ef5b58554b3c04c7d8c9d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文章明确指出当前领域缺乏前瞻性验证、技术标准化不足、地理多样性缺乏，并呼吁开展大型多中心队列研究和随机干预试验。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7b406131f04b8af6ade460d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文章给出了具体的临床行动建议：避免不必要的广谱抗生素、推荐地中海式高纤维饮食、不推荐商业益生菌和SCFA补充剂、FMT仅限临床试验。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7dca157fb29354115581be76\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文章强调了SCFAs作用的上下文依赖性（Context-dependent），即同一代谢物在不同微环境下可能产生相反效果。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::35253ee716d91b56449feb1f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述明确排除了肿瘤内微生物组（intratumoral microbiome），仅关注肠道微生物组的系统性影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::18e093e9c0650c0adb6a76bd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的临床关联多为观察性研究，不能直接推断因果关系；FMT等证据来自小规模概念验证试验，效力有限。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ea8815a44607a8b77c2201dc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"所提机制多基于前临床模型，人体内的确切生理浓度和效应阈值尚不明确。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1be3f40b9e3ba9019333cb48\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"不同研究间的技术异质性和地理差异可能导致菌群-疗效关联的不一致性，需谨慎外推。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d4894969daf36d135d810ad5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::4c223c48c000f6845789e3b9\",\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::349f23b247bb74e7f21b4e09\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"local_passages\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"external_calls\": 0,\n          \"passages\": [\n            {\n              \"best_sentence\": \"Landmark clinical and preclinical studies linking the gut microbiome to immune checkpoint inhibitor response and tumor microenvironment modulationImmune checkpoint inhibitor, NSCLC: Non-small cell lung cancer, RCC: Renal cell carcinoma, PFS/OS: Progression-free survival/overall survival, CTLA-4: cytotoxic T-lymphocyte-associated protein 4, FMT: Fecal microbiota transplantation, IFN: Interferon FMT from defined donors, and precision microbial consortia with ICI efficacy as primary endpoints, stratified by tumor immune phenotype.(3) Geographic diversity in study populations to establish generalizability across non-Western cohorts.(4) Longitudinal rather than single-baseline microbiome profiling to capture dynamic changes during ICI treatment.(5) Multivariate predictive modeling integrating microbiome functional data with tumor genomics, host immune profiling, and germline genetics.\",\n              \"card_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\paper_cards\\\\20260922_microbiome_batch\\\\reading\\\\cards\\\\9db1c1ced73dca207c6289b20b4a2914a09ca2b1\\\\0e352726189f698ed7200afeb2df9e1f\\\\attempt-01\\\\PAPER_READING_CARD.json\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.25259/ijmio_8_2026\",\n              \"limits\": [],\n              \"match_terms\": [\n                \"粪菌移植\",\n                \"gut microbiome modulate efficacy immune checkpoint inhibitors solid tumours\",\n                \"ici\",\n                \"nsclc\",\n                \"rcc\"\n              ],\n              \"material_depth\": \"fulltext\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"9db1c1ced73dca207c6289b20b4a2914a09ca2b1\",\n              \"pool_action\": \"already_in_pool\",\n              \"reading_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\paper_cards\\\\20260922_microbiome_batch\\\\materials\\\\9db1c1ced73dca207c6289b20b4a2914a09ca2b1\\\\snapshot-a22ccfd4fa2ec07e546e769c\",\n              \"score\": 45.119645,\n              \"section_path\": [],\n              \"segment_kind\": \"document_block\",\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n              \"text\": \"Practical clinical considerations for microbiome-related interventions in patients receiving immune checkpoint inhibitors Landmark clinical and preclinical studies linking the gut microbiome to immune checkpoint inhibitor response and tumor microenvironment modulationImmune checkpoint inhibitor, NSCLC: Non-small cell lung cancer, RCC: Renal cell carcinoma, PFS/OS: Progression-free survival/overall survival, CTLA-4: cytotoxic T-lymphocyte-associated protein 4, FMT: Fecal microbiota transplantation, IFN: Interferon FMT from defined donors, and precision microbial consortia with ICI efficacy as primary endpoints, stratified by tumor immune phenotype.(3) Geographic diversity in study populations to establish generalizability across non-Western cohorts.(4) Longitudinal rather than single-baseline microbiome profiling to capture dynamic changes during ICI treatment.(5) Multivariate predictive modeling integrating microbiome functional data with tumor genomics, host immune profiling, and germline genetics. Artificial intelligence (AI)-assisted language tools were used during manuscript drafting and language refinement.All scientific content, interpretation, refere\",\n              \"title\": \"The gut microbiome–tumor microenvironment axis in immunotherapy response: Mechanistic insights and clinical implications\",\n              \"usable_fields\": [],\n              \"year\": \"2026\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"question\": \"How does the gut microbiome modulate the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors in solid tumours, and what mechanisms mediate that effect? 微生物干预策略的临床转化现状 系统评估粪菌移植（FMT）、活体生物药（LBPs）、益生菌及饮食干预在实体瘤 ICI 治疗中的临床试验数据，区分初治与难治人群的疗效差异，明确证据等级（I/II 期 vs III 期），并分析供体选择、安全性及标准化挑战。 涵盖人体临床试验（I-III 期），聚焦实体瘤（黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC、CRC 等）。包括 FMT（供体来源、给药途径）、定义菌群（如 CBM588、MRx0518）、益生菌及饮食干预。明确排除纯临床前研究（除非用于解释机制背景）及非 ICI 背景的微生物干预。严格区分观察性关联与干预性因果证据，标注试验设计类型（单臂 vs RCT）及人群特征（初治 vs 经治）。\",\n          \"reading_mode\": \"focused_local_search\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::34a888801e8e6d821b264263\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fa917863b42b865823617a1e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4f68bc3c0e51d3eab948fccf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ad5a28fe0d2f3d68b7b8e60f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"1. 数据收集：使用公开可用的418名NSCLC患者基线肠道微生物组物种谱数据。2. 模型构建：训练机器学习模型预测ICI响应（R vs NR），固定参数，在保留测试集上验证（AUC=0.62，OS曲线差异显著p<0.0001）。3. 筛选子集：聚焦于模型预测价值良好的257名患者。4. 模拟干预：在模型中模拟健康供体FMT和治疗性菌群组合添加到患者基线微生物组中的过程，考察不同定植比例（exposure-dependent）对预测响应概率的影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8dd8758eb8f26ba40de0493c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了一个基于基线微生物组预测ICI响应的机器学习框架，并证实了在特定患者亚群中，通过模拟FMT或定制菌群可提升预测响应率。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的机器学习算法类型、特征选择细节、治疗性菌群的具体组成成分、菌株分离的具体进展以及临床转化的时间表。仅基于回顾性数据的模拟，非前瞻性临床试验结果。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::89e7cfb984cc8f88cb8a9ce6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基于418名NSCLC患者数据的机器学习模型，在从未见过的测试集上\",\n          \"finding\": \"模型平均AUC为0.62，能显著区分总生存期（OS）曲线（p<0.0001）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::93a5dccbe3d93c3c7257faa4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"在模型预测价值良好的257名患者子集中，模拟健康供体FMT添加\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT提高了模型预测的响应率，且效果依赖于暴露量（即FMT物种定植并替换患者基线微生物组的比例）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a54ca17131fe904ae7af49e9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"在相同子集中，模拟候选治疗性菌群组合添加\",\n          \"finding\": \"候选治疗性菌群组合同样提高了响应率，且结果也呈现剂量/定植依赖性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::679f65a7a246700078865033\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b5b1d19764f6694dbdc7af78\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"现有研究中单个微生物物种与ICI响应的关联往往不可重复且统计效力不足；虽然FMT显示有益，但药物开发多集中于简单菌群组合。本研究试图在模型中复制FMT的治疗益处，并设计能够增强ICI响应的治疗性微生物组合。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ae8542404f12e8b138fd3320\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"基于418名非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者的基线肠道微生物组数据，构建机器学习模型以预测免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）的响应情况；并在模拟环境中评估粪菌移植（FMT）及设计型活细菌疗法对ICI疗效的影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4ae34442850db6176f0dc26c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究旨在解决个体微生物物种与ICI响应关联缺乏统计稳健性的问题，并探索通过微生物组干预改善ICI疗效的策略。作者利用418名NSCLC患者的基线微生物组数据训练了一个区分响应者（R）与非响应者（NR）的机器学习模型（AUC=0.62）。随后，在具有良好预测价值的子集（n=257）中，通过模拟实验评估了健康供体FMT和自定义治疗性菌群组合的效果。结果显示，增加FMT或治疗性菌群的定植比例可依赖性地提高模型预测的响应率。结论认为这些候选疗法有潜力改善ICI患者响应，目前正进行菌株分离培养以开发联合疗法。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8ac1b1eac700149a344ed443\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"模型性能中等（AUC 0.62），且仅在NSCLC队列中验证，外推至其他实体瘤需谨慎。所给摘要未交代模型的可解释性（即哪些具体菌群驱动了预测）。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了基于全谱微生物组而非单一物种的ICI响应预测模型构建方法，并量化了模型性能（AUC 0.62）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a23aef9604c65bbc592eb585\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这是基于计算机模拟的结果，非体内或体外实验验证。所给摘要未交代具体的分子机制（如抗原呈递、炎症调节等），仅停留在表型预测层面。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了通过“恢复响应者样微生物组特征”来克服ICI无响应的设计策略，并通过模拟证明了FMT和定制菌群的潜在有效性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9427443eb0fa7c8aa3845ea9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"418名NSCLC患者的基线微生物组数据及其与ICI响应的统计关联分析。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::caf5e2a920fd8e6427e41f2c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"候选治疗性菌群的设计逻辑（围绕供体FMT和ICI响应相关物种及机制）及菌株分离培养的进展。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::107cddc181c0ebe6140204b3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究仅为摘要级别，所有关于“治疗性菌群”的具体成分、作用机制及临床前/临床数据均未知，不得推断其具体功效或安全性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::32be3241aa6be5e4aa9c6909\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"模型基于回顾性数据，模拟结果不代表真实临床疗效，需明确区分“预测模型中的响应率提升”与“实际患者生存获益”。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1b85f9454a1366e32d8300b8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象限定为NSCLC，其微生物组特征可能与其他实体瘤不同，跨癌种推广需谨慎。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4c5791d22681d874f3bce1ab\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作者声称的“promise”为初步概念验证，尚处于菌株分离和培养阶段，距离实际应用仍有距离。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::674ce0ddf3f79ba2358a5d60\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0329\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::668c479a5777d8a189e172af\",\n          \"snapshot::7f4d4d07befb7d6373432503\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1f6436d467e7e0b57e2f07b2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e1cc78c58c16c3bbdbbf2ee2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::00a19ae4aaf57c17faf6d44e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用系统性文献综合路线。首先梳理肠道微生物组调节局部及全身免疫的基础生物学机制（受体信号通路、表观遗传调控）。其次，分类汇总临床前研究（主要是小鼠模型），分析特定菌株对树突状细胞、T细胞极化及肿瘤微环境的影响。再次，系统检索并归纳人类临床研究数据，包括回顾性队列、前瞻性观察研究及I/II期临床试验，按癌种（肺癌、肾癌、黑色素瘤等）和治疗类型进行分层分析。最后，结合专家观点与现有文献缺口，提出整合多组学、体外功能 assay 及标准化临床试验的未来研究框架。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::71d806cb03a92d98e2986d9d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了益生菌增强ICI疗效的多层次机制全景图，连接了微生物代谢物、免疫细胞亚群及肿瘤微环境重塑。\",\n          \"limits\": \"机制部分主要基于小鼠模型，其外推至人类的适用性受限；人类数据多为观察性，存在选择偏倚和混杂因素。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9d832b25167ebcddca09a6b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"系统整理了截至2025年的临床前及早期临床证据，揭示了不同癌种和益生菌类型的响应差异。\",\n          \"limits\": \"临床数据异质性高，难以得出统一的疗效结论；缺乏长期安全性和长期定植效果的数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::33a9645f6cef26721b0123d6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"明确了当前领域的关键瓶颈（标准化缺失、监管障碍、因果推断困难），并为未来研究设计了方法论框架。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，未提供新的原始实验数据；提出的未来方向需后续实证研究验证。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::302a80f9ec357636e98d3b23\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"临床前小鼠模型（黑色素瘤、结直肠癌等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"特定益生菌（如双歧杆菌、乳酸杆菌、Clostridium butyricum、Akkermansia muciniphila）可通过激活树突状细胞、促进MHC-I抗原呈递、调节细胞因子谱（增加IFN-γ, TNF-α）、诱导巨噬细胞向M1型极化以及产生SCFAs等代谢物，增强CD8+ T细胞浸润和活性，从而协同ICI发挥抗肿瘤作用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ff7bc74c4a0e8a80d1f6f4d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"人类回顾性及前瞻性观察研究（非小细胞肺癌、转移性肾细胞癌、黑色素瘤）\",\n          \"finding\": \"多项研究显示，使用益生菌（尤其是Clostridium butyricum MIYAIRI 588或多种混合菌株）与改善无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）相关。例如，在一项NSCLC回顾性研究中，益生菌使用者中位PFS显著延长；在mRCC的前瞻性研究中，CBM588联合nivolumab/ipilimumab显示出更高的客观缓解率（ORR）和PFS。然而，部分商业益生菌补充剂在非标准化使用时可能无效甚至有害。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3126473c4fbc3a92dfe180c6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）管理\",\n          \"finding\": \"某些益生菌株（如Bifidobacterium spp., Lactobacillus spp.）在动物模型中可减轻ICI诱导的结肠炎。在人类观察性研究中，较高的有益菌丰度或与irAEs风险降低相关，但临床数据不一致，部分研究显示益生菌使用并未增加irAEs发生率，而在联合化疗时可能增加特定毒性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::30453997df29189781838b94\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"方法学与标准化现状\",\n          \"finding\": \"大多数临床证据来自回顾性研究，缺乏随机对照试验（RCT）。使用的益生菌制剂高度异质化（单株vs多株，商业补充剂vs定义明确的菌株），且受饮食、抗生素使用、种族等混杂因素影响严重。目前尚无法确定最佳菌株、剂量及给药方案。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::717397c1cb049347f7f2933f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8c94036e7aec735063a13814\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管肠道微生物组已知能调节ICI疗效，但基于微生物组的干预措施（特别是益生菌）在临床实施中面临挑战。本研究旨在解决：1）益生菌如何通过具体免疫机制增强ICI疗效？2）目前关于益生菌在人类癌症患者中应用的临床证据质量如何？3）该领域存在哪些主要障碍（如标准化、安全性、混杂因素），需要何种研究设计来克服？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7182dbc1a8c2edca834f2177\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"聚焦于肠道微生物组（gut microbiome）与癌症免疫治疗，特别是免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）之间的相互作用。研究对象包括益生菌（probiotics）、益生元、后生元及粪便微生物移植等微生物靶向策略，涵盖从基础机制到临床前模型及早期临床试验的证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2e70d09ab215c701a9eb32bc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在批判性评估益生菌作为癌症免疫治疗辅助手段的现有证据。文章首先概述了肠道微生物组通过代谢物（如短链脂肪酸、色氨酸衍生物、胆汁酸）和分子模式调节宿主免疫系统的机制，进而阐述这些机制如何影响ICI疗效。随后，重点讨论了特定益生菌菌株在临床前小鼠模型中增强抗肿瘤免疫反应的潜力，并汇总了来自回顾性队列、前瞻性观察研究及早期临床试验的人类数据，探讨益生菌对ICI疗效及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。最后，文章指出了当前研究的局限性，如菌株标准化缺失、混杂因素干扰及因果关系的未确定性，并提出了整合纵向多组学、体外共培养及类器官模型等未来研究方向，以推动益生菌从膳食补充剂向经过验证的临床辅助疗法转化。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ebf057532e81f91a3c1deb34\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"所有临床数据均为回顾性或早期前瞻性观察研究，存在显著的混杂因素（如基线微生物组成、饮食、合并用药）。不能直接证明因果关系，仅能提供关联证据。样本量和随访时间有限，长期疗效未知。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了益生菌在多种实体瘤（NSCLC, mRCC, 黑色素瘤）中与ICI联用的临床观察结果，包括PFS、OS和ORR的变化趋势。特别指出了Clostridium butyricum MIYAIRI 588在肺癌和肾癌中的积极信号，以及商业混合益生菌在某些情况下的无效性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2151952a4c6ff4b033e7e506\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"大部分机制细节源自小鼠模型（germ-free mice, gnotobiotic models）。人类体内确切的因果链条尚未完全确立，许多通路在人体中的确切贡献度和主导性尚不明确。不同菌株的作用机制可能存在显著差异，综述中的机制概括可能掩盖菌株特异性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细描述了益生菌调节免疫的具体分子和细胞机制：1）通过SCFAs激活GPCRs并抑制HDAC，促进Treg分化或增强CD8+ T细胞功能；2）通过AhR通路调节色氨酸代谢；3）通过STING通路激活DC和巨噬细胞，促进M1极化；4）通过分子模拟（molecular mimicry）交叉激活T细胞。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4e3e5363e3b1e6060c91a4ba\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"临床数据矛盾且不充分。动物模型结果不能直接外推至人类。缺乏大规模RCT数据支持益生菌对irAEs的确切保护作用。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"分析了益生菌对ICI诱导的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的双向影响，指出某些菌株可能减轻结肠炎，而其他情况下可能增加毒性或无显著影响。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bd22fb14494e0354503b38df\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"介绍了肠道微生物组作为“第二基因组”的概念，及其通过GALT、代谢物和MAMPs调节全身免疫的基础理论。定义了益生菌、益生元、后生元和FMT的区别。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6830f3216aaff9dac057e352\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"强调了当前临床研究中益生菌制剂的非标准化、商业产品的标签准确性问题、以及饮食/抗生素/种族等混杂因素的复杂性。提出了整合纵向多组学、ex vivo assays和gut-on-a-chip模型的必要性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::114f3b3942444b88c43854a5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"引用Spencer等人的研究，显示非标准化的商业益生菌补充剂在小鼠模型和人类队列中可能损害ICI反应，减少IFN-γ阳性T细胞。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::960d60a84711ed898ae3e67f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述主要关注肠道微生物组，虽然提及皮肤、肺等其他部位微生物，但核心证据集中在肠道。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d798c8e48d06d32471513b4a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"临床数据主要来自回顾性研究和早期试点试验，缺乏大型III期RCT结果，因此任何关于疗效的结论都带有强烈的观察性关联性质，而非确证性因果证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::61e55c65ca40d7a2eecea481\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制描述多基于小鼠模型，直接应用于人类需谨慎，因为人鼠微生物组和免疫系统存在差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::31ab31711e6241723cdfa314\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的“益生菌”涵盖从商业混合补充剂到定义明确的单一菌株（如CBM588），两者在成分、质量控制和潜在效果上截然不同，比较时需严格区分。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c16be694b7f8f95168cc4cea\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0357\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-d48cd64bd12b302ad2ba\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-76a4a344a1a9861e53c5\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-95bd9a77b14edf06222c\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd94\",\n          \"snapshot::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::297360b98d6705da27fdef6c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e3a4f29ae0327075e8a0f972\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0eee6b0fc85c1aa61c7d0f69\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用叙述性综述方法。电子数据库搜索策略包括关键词“cancer”、“immunotherapy/immune checkpoint inhibitor”和“microbiome/microbiota”。纳入标准限定为：成人（>18岁）、英文全文、同行评审期刊发表的研究。排除动物模型研究以专注于临床应用证据。对纳入的10项研究进行定性综合，按癌症类型（黑色素瘤、HCC、NSCLC等）和治疗结果（疗效、irAEs、FMT干预）分类整理发现。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f0e5381ebc2cc88f3e2bff9f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"首次专门针对临床研究的综述，汇总了肠道微生物组作为ICIs疗效预测生物标志物和irAEs风险因子的证据，强调了FMT在逆转耐药性方面的初步临床可行性。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所纳入的研究样本量普遍较小（多数n≤42），存在异质性（不同癌症类型、不同ICI药物、不同测序方法如16S rRNA与宏基因组）。观察性研究无法确立因果关系。未对纳入的非随机研究进行严格的质量偏倚风险评估。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cd1eb32400edde04370e97c2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"接受ICIs治疗的晚期癌症患者（黑色素瘤、HCC、NSCLC等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"基线肠道微生物组的多样性和组成与ICIs疗效显著相关。高α-多样性通常与较长的PFS和OS相关。特定菌属富集与响应正相关（如Fecalibacterium prausnitzii, Bifidobacterium longum, Akkermansia muciniphila），而某些拟杆菌目（Bacteroidales）丰度高则与非响应相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f5d7e1fba79b4eaef4b2e294\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"接受CTLA-4抑制剂治疗的黑色素瘤患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"低丰度的Bacteroidetes门细菌与免疫检查点抑制剂诱导的结肠炎（GI毒性）相关；相反，较高的Bacteroidetes丰度与抵抗结肠炎发生相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::10fa00141f5ccb618952ade4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"抗PD-1难治性转移性黑色素瘤患者接受来自响应者的FMT\",\n          \"finding\": \"两项突破性临床试验显示，将来自免疫治疗响应者的粪菌移植给难治性患者，结合抗PD-1治疗，可使部分患者重新获得临床响应（Baruch et al. 3/10响应；Davar et al. 6/15响应），且安全性良好。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::322e6c1f1dc5e420331aed00\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3e9b4c255e7f49de211bb37f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管免疫疗法提高了部分晚期癌症患者的生存率，但仅少数患者受益且常伴随严重免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。目前尚缺乏基于临床证据的指导方针来利用肠道微生物组预测治疗反应或管理副作用。本研究试图厘清肠道微生物组作为预测生物标志物的潜力及其在增强疗效和减少副作用中的作用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::da974f2fb7161247d30ad326\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"临床癌症患者（晚期转移性黑色素瘤、肝细胞癌、非小细胞肺癌及肾细胞癌），聚焦于免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗前后的肠道微生物组特征及其与疗效和不良事件的关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::39e920e15e0d4141f1858275\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述旨在评估肠道微生物组对癌症患者免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）临床结局及相关不良事件（AEs）的影响。作者检索了截至2021年3月的PubMed、Medline和ScienceDirect数据库，筛选出10项涉及成年人的临床研究。研究综合分析了基线微生物组的多样性（α/β多样性）和组成成分与ICIs疗效（无进展生存期PFS、总生存期OS）及胃肠道毒性（如结肠炎）之间的关联，并探讨了粪菌移植（FMT）在难治性患者中的潜在调节作用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0539b1b2c53b3d7b72cb824c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些关联主要基于观察性研究，存在癌症类型异质性和样本量小的限制，不能直接推断因果机制。不同研究中具体差异菌种存在不一致性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了多项临床研究数据，表明基线肠道微生物组的特定组成（如Faecalibacterium prausnitzii, Bifidobacterium longum, Akkermansia muciniphila的高丰度）和较高多样性与ICIs治疗的良好临床响应（延长PFS/OS）相关。同时指出Bacteroidales的高丰度与非响应相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::080e444842a4a14c522c5a13\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅两项研究涉及此方面，且主要针对CTLA-4抑制剂，推广至其他ICI需谨慎。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了肠道微生物组与免疫治疗不良反应（特别是结肠炎）的联系。低Bacteroidetes丰度与CTLA-4诱导的结肠炎风险增加相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0fc5763ac32ca8ee7111a467\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"样本量极小，仅为概念验证性质。供体和受体间的个体差异、预处理抗生素的使用等因素可能影响结果。尚未阐明具体的分子机制或关键菌株。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"通过FMT临床试验（Baruch et al., Davar et al.）展示了从响应者向难治者移植微生物组可恢复部分患者的治疗响应，并观察到CD8+ T细胞激活增加和IL-8表达髓系细胞减少。这为微生物组介导免疫治疗效应的因果假设提供了最强的临床间接证据。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0151b710263ede70d23b60e6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"主要是相关性观察，未详细区分抗生素种类、使用时机及具体影响的菌群通路。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"指出抗生素使用（尤其是ICIs期间）与较差的PFS和OS相关，提示抗生素引起的菌群失调可能是导致免疫治疗耐药的一个因素。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::71bcf8d226c8b935ca4f2b4c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述指出目前尚无基于临床证据的指南来利用微生物组指导免疫治疗，且既往综述多包含动物模型，导致临床应用存在差距。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::327e635fac3256de3a41f1db\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提到现有研究在测序方法（16S vs 宏基因组）、样本采集时间点上的异质性，以及缺乏标准化的偏倚评估工具。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::89b7ba4679aef53d9192191a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"汇总了黑色素瘤、HCC、NSCLC中不同的优势菌种（如黑色素瘤中Faecalibacterium，HCC中Akkermansia/Ruminococcaceae，NSCLC中Akkermansia/Alistipes）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b7b952d0d492ff2d26e93bff\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述仅纳入临床研究，排除了动物实验，因此其关于机制的解释（如T细胞激活）主要基于人类临床样本的相关性或FMT后的表型变化，而非直接的分子通路解析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b81452e6f8c2cf88f589c219\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"发现的菌群与疗效的关联多为观察性结果，存在混杂因素（如饮食、生活方式、合并用药），不能直接视为因果证据，除非有FMT等干预性研究的支持。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::17045e9a74e743196a9ec5a9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"不同研究间使用的测序区域（V3-V4, V4, V4-V5）和分析方法不同，导致具体菌种鉴定可能存在偏差，比较时需考虑技术异质性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::91f185a2d063fd5c2d47e7ba\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"FMT研究样本量极小（n=10, n=15），结果仅代表初步安全性和可行性，不能代表普遍疗效。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7acb9f11d1a63262fa2e4e18\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"The review details methodological heterogeneity across the included studies, such as variations in sequencing regions (V3-V4, V4, V4-V5), sample collection times, and cancer types, which complicates direct comparison. It also notes that only two studies examined gastrointestinal toxicity (colitis), finding low Bacteroidetes abundance associated with higher risk. The authors mention that while FMT response rates in these small studies are comparable to RCTs for Clostridioides difficile infection, the cancer FMT studies themselves are described as 'breakthrough clinical studies' rather than large-scale Phase III trials. The review excludes animal models to focus on clinical applicability but acknowledges that most included studies are observational (retrospective or prospective cohorts) rather than randomized interventions.\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"phase_iii_rct_evidence\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\level2\\\\external\\\\N48436b3aa73aea86f35f-f45b87be8e30256e\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\phase_iii_rct_evidence\\\\attempt-c7j_i2fn\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_2d56a11919\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"The specific evidence requested—completed large-scale randomized controlled Phase III clinical trials confirming microbiome intervention (FMT) efficacy in ICI-treated solid tumors—is not present in this material. The available FMT data is limited to small-sample (n=10, n=15), early-phase studies restricted to refractory melanoma, not broad solid tumors. The authors' call for future robust RCTs and multicentre trials indicates that such Phase III evidence does not yet exist or was not captured in this review (search up to March 2021).\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"This study is a clinical review analyzing 10 studies (total n=467 patients) regarding the gut microbiome and immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) outcomes in solid tumors (melanoma, HCC, NSCLC, RCC). It reports that baseline microbiome diversity and composition (e.g., enrichment of Faecalibacterium, Akkermansia, Bifidobacterium) are associated with improved progression-free survival (PFS) and overall survival (OS), while Bacteroidales abundance often correlates with non-response. Crucially for the gap, the authors highlight two FMT clinical studies (Baruch et al., n=10; Davar et al., n=15) in anti-PD-1 refractory metastatic melanoma. These studies demonstrated safety and potential efficacy (30-40% response rate) when combining FMT from responders with ICI re-challenge. However, the authors explicitly state that 'further well-designed RCTs are required to explore the causal effects' and that 'future international multicentre trials will be required to provide comprehensive and reliable data.' They note that up-to-date practice guidelines based on clinical evidence are not yet available.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5f4a3067c60d9ca5815c45e7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a96686bee2f7be7a8dd8\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-724817b1ad2fa81c8182\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-ba354d40740f64366cbf\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-403bce67afb0fdb07c1f\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2694ad4ea52a0088aba17fec\",\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\",\n          \"snapshot::17ec529e254380cf6b84cb88\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9c0275a5e34adb0279612f6a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::eb554c2581ab757501df96e5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::18f1e0027dc274d710422af9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0303\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::77186f2ef181ee4ddaa8ebfc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::472b4940b21448ebf2b32460\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0303\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::77186f2ef181ee4ddaa8ebfc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a11c34c0060b848051885d47\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0303\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"As a narrative review, the authors systematically organized existing literature into thematic sections: (1) mechanisms of anti-tumor immunity and ICI resistance; (2) biological crosstalk between gut microbiota and the immune system; (3) summary of clinical studies correlating microbiome composition with ICI response in specific cancers; (4) evaluation of microbiome modulation strategies (diet, probiotics, FMT); and (5) discussion of methodological limitations and future directions. The approach involves synthesizing findings from preclinical models and human clinical trials, comparing results across different studies, and critically assessing the consistency and reliability of reported microbial associations.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::77186f2ef181ee4ddaa8ebfc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c2f9240e3395358f5801fe35\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0303\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides a structured synthesis of the complex relationship between gut microbiota and ICI efficacy, categorizing mechanisms (metabolite-mediated, immune modulation) and summarizing clinical correlations across multiple tumor types.\",\n          \"limits\": \"As a narrative review, it does not perform a systematic meta-analysis with statistical pooling. The field is characterized by high heterogeneity and conflicting results, which the review acknowledges but cannot fully resolve due to the nature of the included studies.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::77186f2ef181ee4ddaa8ebfc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5de6adbf5a5bf3c90fe3d432\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0303\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Identifies critical methodological pitfalls in current microbiome research, such as sample handling inconsistencies, lack of strain-level resolution, and uncontrolled confounders (diet, antibiotics), offering a roadmap for improving future study design.\",\n          \"limits\": \"The recommendations for future research are prospective; the review itself relies on existing data which may be biased by publication or selection effects common in early-stage microbiome studies.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::77186f2ef181ee4ddaa8ebfc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c20c39cdfa67e57e360435e8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0303\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"In melanoma and NSCLC patients treated with ICIs\",\n          \"finding\": \"Specific bacterial taxa are correlated with ICI response, but results are often conflicting. Generally, higher alpha-diversity and abundance of certain commensals like *Bifidobacterium*, *Faecalibacterium prausnitzii*, and *Akkermansia muciniphila* are associated with better responses and prolonged progression-free survival (PFS). Conversely, some studies link *Bacteroides* species to either positive or negative outcomes depending on the specific species and ICI type.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::77186f2ef181ee4ddaa8ebfc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d0fc4b4517bdbf1143ec35ec\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0303\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Preclinical and mechanistic studies\",\n          \"finding\": \"Gut microbiota modulate immunity via metabolites (e.g., short-chain fatty acids, inosine) and surface molecules (e.g., LPS, PSA). For instance, *B. pseudolongum* produces inosine which enhances T-cell activation via A2AR signaling, and *A. muciniphila* can induce pro-inflammatory cytokines and suppress Tregs, thereby enhancing anti-tumor immunity.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::77186f2ef181ee4ddaa8ebfc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ec736986f0c0de06668a4018\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0303\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Clinical intervention studies\",\n          \"finding\": \"Fecal Microbiota Transplantation (FMT) from responders to non-responders has shown promise in augmenting ICI efficacy in subsets of melanoma patients. Dietary interventions rich in fiber and probiotic supplementation are being investigated in ongoing trials to improve outcomes.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::77186f2ef181ee4ddaa8ebfc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::555e4db4924ab38f3df0dcd7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0303\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::77186f2ef181ee4ddaa8ebfc\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::df86d43f8b68022fc8065f20\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0303\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review addresses the problem that a significant proportion of patients with solid tumors exhibit primary or acquired resistance to ICIs. It seeks to understand the role of the gut microbiome in this resistance and response variability, aiming to identify microbial signatures associate